- The HTML sets up a basic form layout with buttons to add and submit questions.
- Bootstrap is used for styling and making the form responsive.
- JavaScript/jQuery handlers dynamically add and remove questions and allow reordering with drag-and-drop functionality.
- When the user submits the survey, the collected questions are displayed in an alert, simulating form submission.

